Elven cloak gives stealth.  Rangers get stealth at XP=3D7.
So from XP=3D1-6 the stealth is an advantage after which
it's only the MC=3D3 as an advantage.  I like the effect of
stealth that monsters out of visual range can't track you
as well so they tend to form crowds less.

The displacement effect lasts the rest of the game and
effects monsters in combat situations.  Both elven and
displacement give 1 point of AC.

An interesting factor is the DevTeam assigns displacement
a price of 50, elven a price of 60.  Sounds like they value
the MC=3D3 a bit more.

Given these factors I think they are close to equivalent
in the early game.


